+
+## Till sales
+
+`POST /import/sales` accepts a JSON object with a `csv` string containing
+`ticket,soldAt,dishId,qty`. Use a zoned ISO instant and a positive whole
+dish quantity. The response counts distinct new tickets and total dishes
+sold. A row error rolls back the entire import.
+
+`GET /reports/variance?from=YYYY-MM-DD&to=YYYY-MM-DD` returns an array
+ordered by itemId for the inclusive UTC date range. Each row contains
+`itemId`, `theoretical`, `actual`, and `variance` (actual minus theoretical),
+all quantities in the item's unit. Items with no use are omitted.
